   "html_text": "Physics includes Aristotle’s On the soul and scholars have paid much attention to al-Fārābī’s little treatise On intellect (ed. by M. Bouyges, 1983). A full English translation of this important treatise, of which there exist two Medieval Latin versions, was finally given by McGinnis & Reisman in their Classical Arabic Philosophy (2007: 68–78). Philippe Vallat published an extensive study of al-Fārābī’s views on the intellect (2019a). More recently Jawdath Jabbour offered a detailed study of thi",
